# IndieHunt

IndieHunt (https://indiehunt.io) is a weekly launch platform for AI products and indie SaaS.

- Public reads need no API key: GET /api/v1/projects, /api/v1/search, /api/v1/categories, /api/v1/weeks/current.
- The OpenAPI document is /openapi.json. Agent auth is /auth.md.
- Product MCP is https://indiehunt.io/mcp. Docs MCP is https://indiehunt.io/mcp/docs.
- Do not invent a paid nofollow plan. Free is $0. Premium is $29 one-time.
- New free tools go only in app/libs/free-tools.js. Do not add individual tool links to the header or footer.
- Do not commit .env files or secrets.
- Prefer Markdown exports (Accept: text/markdown or a .md URL) over scraping HTML.
